msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu. How'd it go with Mama?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Well... it's kind of a tough situation. Her last husband was\r\n"
"a cop. She says he died in the line of duty trying to save\r\n"
"her when she got held hostage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"She also said that being with somebody who came out of the\r\n"
"force reminds her of that awful day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "So she's still got him on her mind, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Wait, you knew she was married?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Yeah... Her husband, Keisuke, was a cop under my\r\n"
"jurisdiction. We crossed paths during a particularly\r\n"
"dangerous case..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"We were going after a serial armed robber by the name of Tsukishima. Guy was"
" a real scumbag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "After we tracked him down, Keisuke managed to corner Tsukishima."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"But then Mama walked by and that thug took her hostage. Held his gun right "
"to her temple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"We got the okay to shoot Tsukishima, but Keisuke was too\r\n"
"afraid he'd hit his wife. So he hesitated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "And it cost him his life?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Yup. Tsukishima took that opportunity to shoot first, and that was it... "
"Keisuke went down. It was over in the blink of an eye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Keisuke did everything he could to protect Mama without pulling the "
"trigger... Maybe that was all he could do, given the circumstances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"If Keisuke had shot, there was no guarantee he wouldn't hit his wife. And "
"even if he could hit Tsukishima, he'd have to end it in one bullet. "
"Otherwise Mama would pay the price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "...That's a decision no one should have to make."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"I never could see Keisuke taking another man's life. He always saw the best "
"in even the worst of people... But his kindness ended up doing him in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "What happened to Tsukishima?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"The moment he shot Keisuke, the squad moved in to take him down. Long story "
"short, Tsukishima got sent to the pen, and Mama, she... survived, but she "
"lost her other half."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"I've always felt responsible, since the killer was under my jurisdiction. So"
" I've been looking after Mama ever since."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"I think I understand. Closing the door on you was her way of closing the "
"door to those painful memories... of losing someone she loved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Maybe that can be fixed. Date-san, does she know you were in charge of the "
"case?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"No, and I'd like to keep it that way. She thinks Keisuke just happened to be"
" at the scene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Anyway. Only thing I could do for Mama was set her up at Serena and show my "
"face there every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "...That was something like nine years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"At first, I looked after her out of a sense of duty to a fallen comrade. But"
" sooner or later... I fell for her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Sounds like you two have quite the history already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Huh!? Wait a sec..."
msgstr "Eh? Aspetta un attimo..."

msgctxt "464"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "476"
msgid "That guy... I knew I've seen him before!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Kiryu, that's Tsukishima!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"The man who was talking to Mama at the counter! He's the one who shot "
"Keisuke!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Are you sure about this?"
msgstr "Sei sicuro di questo?"

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Hundred percent. He might look a little different than he used to, but I'll "
"never forget those eyes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Why would he be at Serena, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "You don't think⑬!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Date-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"(Was he really the same person who murdered Mama's husband? If so, I can't "
"just leave them alone at Serena!)"
msgstr ""

